<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.02 vs   1.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.95 vs   0.73</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.80 vs   0.11 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   22.71 vs  16.61</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.84 vs   1.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.85 vs   1.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.41 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Sales		   38.75 vs  31.98</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is Budimex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
